    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aecŭlānum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aeclānum</span></b> , i,
			n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				city of the Hirpini in Samnium</i>, now <i>Le
				Grotte</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 7, 3, 1</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. ib. 16, 2, 4</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			5019</span></i>.—Hence: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aecŭlāni</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Æc.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 11,
				16, § 105</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut.
				444, 5</span></i>; and: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aecŭlā-nenses</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aeclānenses</span></b> ,
			ium, the same as <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aecŭlāni</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 838, 862</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3108
		al.</span></i></div>
